        "node_id": "n_3_a2b4f1",
        "thought_text": "Directly simulate the process of incrementing a or b until they become equal, keeping track of the number of operations. This brute-force method, while not optimal in terms of time complexity, is straightforward and ensures correctness by exhaustively trying all possible sequences of operations.",
